OL,3,AState pension likely to rise by 3.9%
OL,4,Anext April
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe state pension is likely to rise by
OL,7,F3.9% next April, according to the
OL,8,Flatest jobs and pay data.
OL,10,FUnder the triple lock pension
OL,11,Fguarantee, an increase is based on
OL,12,Feither average wage growth, inflation
OL,13,For 2.5% - whichever is highest.
